@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (시드 user 101 — 001_dev_sample_data.sql)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-myultary-test-001",
  "email": "myultary.test@example.com",
  "name": "마이울타리테스트"
}

### 1. 마이울타리 정보 조회 (hasStory, petCount, feedCount 등)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. MY 게시글 그리드 (feed 101)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/feeds?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. MY 게시글 상세 (시드 feedId=101)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/feeds/101
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. 저장한 게시글 그리드 (시드: feed 102 저장)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/saved-feeds?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 태그된 게시글 그리드 (시드: feed 102에 choco COLLABORATOR/멘션)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/tagged-feeds?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6a. 프로필 사진 변경 (시드 fileId=100~103 이미지)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileFileId": 103
}

### 6b. 프로필 사진 제거
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "removeProfileFile": true
}

### 7a. 소개글 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/bio
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "강아지랑 산책하는 집사"
}

### 7b. 소개글 삭제
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/bio
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clearBio": true
}

### 8a. 내 스토리 목록 (시드 story 101)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8b. 스토리 등록 (이미지 — 시드 fileId=100)
# @name createStory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileId": 100,
  "mediaType": "IMAGE",
  "caption": "오늘 산책"
}

### 8c. 스토리 등록 (영상 — 시드 fileId=104, 썸네일 103)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileId": 104,
  "mediaType": "VIDEO",
  "thumbnailFileId": 103,
  "durationSec": 12,
  "caption": "짧은 영상"
}

### 8d. 스토리 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-ultary/stories/{{createStory.response.body.$.data.storyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
